  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-13T14:00:00-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, March 13, 2021, 2:00 pm\">March 13, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-247 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 03/13/2021 - 03/20/2021<br /><i>2:00 pm - 4:00 pm</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-4ec104acd12a8d9f8b60/\">Monthly Meeting</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Guild of Harwich Artists’ March General Meeting will be held this Saturday, March 13 from 2:00 – 4:00 p.m. via Zoom.</p>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">We are meeting a week earlier this month to accommodate attendance at the Saturday, March 20th 1:00 – 5:00 p.m. Chatham Bars Inn ‘Meet the Artist’ Series’ featuring 17 Guild artists.</div>\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">General meetings are open to the public. If you know of a prospective new member, by all means invite them to join us by passing along the following Zoom link:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88034637085?fbclid=IwAR25NmASQSijgSQgGTRLM_3DeqcRckL-VcjEfWpvjFmPGaR-MfXcRfR8LE8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88034637085</a></p>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
